{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01481","headline":"舞曲歌辞 公莫舞歌 · 李贺","name":"舞曲歌辞 公莫舞歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方花古础排九楹，刺豹淋血盛银甖。\n华筵鼓吹无桐竹，长刀直立割鸣筝。\n横楣麤锦生红纬，日炙锦嫣王未醉。\n腰下三看宝玦光，项庄掉箾拦前起。\n材官小臣公莫舞，座上真人赤龙子。\n芒砀云瑞抱天回，咸阳王气清如水。\n铁枢铁楗重束关，大旗五丈撞双环。\n汉王今日须秦印，绝膑刳肠臣不论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}